@startuml comment
actor User
participant "Router" as R
participant "Comment.controller" as C
participant "Comment.service" as S
participant "CommentModel" as MComment
participant "TestModel" as MTest

'=== GET /test/:testId ===
User -> R: GET /test/:testId
R -> C: getCommentsByTest()
C -> S: getCommentsByTest(testId,page,limit)
S -> MComment: aggregate/lookup replies
MComment --> S: comments
S --> C: { comments, pagination }
C -> R: JSON
R --> User: response

'=== GET /:parentId/replies ===
User -> R: GET /:parentId/replies
R -> C: getRepliesByComment()
C -> S: getRepliesByComment(parentId,page,limit)
S -> MComment: find({ parent_id })
MComment --> S: replies
S -> MComment: countDocuments({ parent_id })
MComment --> S: total
S --> C: { comments, pagination }
C -> R: JSON
R --> User: response

'=== POST /test/:testId ===
User -> R: POST /test/:testId { content, parentId }
R -> C: createComment()
C -> S: createComment(userId,testId,content,parentId)
S -> MComment: create(newComment)
MComment --> S: savedComment
S -> MTest: findByIdAndUpdate(testId, { $inc: { countComment: 1 } })
MTest --> S: updated
S --> C: savedComment
C -> R: JSON 201
R --> User: response

@enduml
